  Schedule:Compact,
    ACTIVITY_SCH,                 !- Name  Source: NREL PDF Table B-2, p.73 (page 84 of the file): ACTIVITY_SCH, All, 120 for all 24 hours.
    ,                             !- Schedule Type Limits Name
    Through: 12/31,               !- Field 1
    For: AllDays,                 !- Field 2
    Until: 24:00,120;             !- Field 3

! HVAC system type of every zone from the xlsx (Zone and HVAC System Summary, HVAC System Type Dictionary): 7 VAV with reheat (chilled water cooling, hot-water fossil fuel boiler) for all zones except the kitchen, 12 SZ-CV-HW (single-zone constant volume, chilled water cooling, hot-water boiler heating) for the kitchen. The xlsx names the HVAC system of each zone (raw_data column I): VAV_1, VAV_2, VAV_ER, VAV_OR, VAV_ICU, VAV_PATRMS, VAV_LABS and CAV_KITCHEN. All equipment data are EnergyPlus defaults.
! One thermostat for all zones: the xlsx gives one heating and one cooling set point schedule (Schedule Summary, space type All).
  HVACTemplate:Thermostat,
    HospitalThermostat,           !- Name
    HTGSETP_SCH,                  !- Heating Setpoint Schedule Name  Source: xlsx Schedule Summary 'Heating Set Point', rows 419/420/421 (Mon - Fri/Sat/Sun).
